    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/1e9d0c793772117838c450787da9c196.poster.avif?t=1752876100\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/1e9d0c793772117838c450787da9c196.webm?t=1752876100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/1e9d0c793772117838c450787da9c196.mp4?t=1752876100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're an ordinary nobody, who has never done anything noteworthy, let alone... a crime. It must be a mistake, \u2013 yet this morning you were arrested. Pack your stuff and leave as fast as possible, but be wary \u2013 every move you make is being followed by a Giant Policeman. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE &amp; PLAN </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u2014 While exploring potential ways to get to the train station, you see the ticket gate. </i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And in a true immersive sim manner, there always are a few options to solve every problem that you face.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MANIPULATE RELATIONSHIPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u2014 Try to give a gift to the cashier, and she might give you a ticket for free. </i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The revitalizing immersive sim formula forces you to manage various characters moods. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/10ec95c71855422685a79d1719215238.poster.avif?t=1752876100\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/10ec95c71855422685a79d1719215238.webm?t=1752876100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/10ec95c71855422685a79d1719215238.mp4?t=1752876100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">OR BREAK THE LAW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u2014 If you want to keep a gift as a backup in case things go south \u2013 just break the ticket gate, or sneak into the cashier\u2019s booth at night to steal a ticket.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">IF YOU GET CAUGHT, TAKE YOUR CHANCES AT ESCAPING FROM THE GIANT\u2019S HAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u2014 While breaking into the cashier's booth you made too much noise and woke up the Giant. Now you must run for your life and seek shelter. </i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">REPEAT UNTIL YOU FIND YOUR WAY OUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u2014 Sell off any found or stolen goods to give yourself an edge moving forward.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE GAME IS BUILT TO BE REACTIVE, TRY EVERYTHING OUT AND SEE WHAT HAPPENS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every character in the game, including the lawbringer, has a tamagochi-like mood system. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dialogue system. The reactive system has free phrase selection. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Theft. You can steal items from the streets, rob apartments, and shops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stealth. The Town is constantly watching. If you get on their bad side, the police could get involved. But always remember, they hate you as much as they hate the Giant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time. Time is the key. Everyone, from cars and trains to people and Giants has their own life schedules. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/ce663a833d6b0c6865ee61d8ba57f47c.poster.avif?t=1752876100\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/ce663a833d6b0c6865ee61d8ba57f47c.webm?t=1752876100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373530/extras/ce663a833d6b0c6865ee61d8ba57f47c.mp4?t=1752876100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
